            "review_text": "Fmover\n14 contributions\n0\nExcellent food and very good price\nJun 2013 • Friends\nThe restaurant is not on the main street, but rather in a perpendicular. It's a great place to take a break from the motorcycle and the joy of a good shade.\nThe staff was very friendly and they always taking care of their customers. The food was very tasty and you can find very good price for all of them. If you are traveling on a low budget I recommend this restaurant. It's small, and perhaps not an impressive building, but you´ll enjoy the moment.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 21, 2013",
